# SHA-256 of every model file behind a published result (sha256sum format).
# The model files are not in git; README, "Data Availability", says how they
# are distributed. Each digest is the one recorded as model.sha256 in the
# metrics_*.json files that used the model.
#
# Check the files you have under models/:
#   python src/verify_models.py
# or, from the repository root, with GNU coreutils:
#   sha256sum --check --ignore-missing models/checksums.sha256
